{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1471563-character-creation-question-15-points-per-path-for-edges","id":1471563,"title":"Character Creation question: 15 points per Path for Edges?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-12-31T15:55:04-08:00","id":1471563,"title":"Character Creation question: 15 points per Path for Edges?","content":"Hi all,<br /> <br /> I looking for some clarification. I appreciate the help. <br /> <br /> In character creation, are you allocated 15 points per Path for Edges? Or is it 15 points for all three Paths. 45 points for Edges seems like a lot. <br /> <br /> Thanks. Happy New Year. <br /> <br /> Best,<br /> Drumheller","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:georgia\">Organizer for the Dead Gamers Society: The So Cal World of Darkness Meetup. </span><a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/85-drumheller","name":"Drumheller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar85_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"55"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-31T16:23:10-08:00","id":1471566,"title":"","content":"You get 15 points in Skills, not Edges. Three points for each Path (for a total of 9), and six in any Skill. You get 10 points in Edges, with two for each Path (6 total) and four in any other Edges for which you meet the prerequisites.<br /> <br /> The 15 points in Edges thing is for making your own Path, where you choose a list of 15 points worth of Edges as Path Edges. Whenever you gain another level in the Path, you get two dots in edges chosen from that list, provided you meet the prerequisites.<br /> <br /> <br /> Edit:<br /> <br /> Let me provide an example. I want to make a new character, but don't like any of the Origin Paths from the book, so I make a Path named &quot;Trust Fund Baby&quot;. I choose the following Skills:<br /> <br /> Command (for ordering around people of lower social status).<br /> Culture (for knowing about fashion, music, dance, etc.).<br /> Persuasion (for speaking with my peers).<br /> Pilot (for driving my very expensive car).<br /> <br /> I also choose the following Edges:<br /> <br /> Wealth - 5 dots (as a Trust Fund Baby, I'm probably rich).<br /> Striking - 2 dots (the idle young rich are often attractive).<br /> Fame - 3 dots (many rich people are celebrities).<br /> Patron - 3 dots (it isn't what you know, it's who you know).<br /> Skilled Liar - 2 dots (have you ever seen one of those idle rich reality shows?).<br /> <br /> Edge total - 15 dots.<br /> <br /> When making the character, I put three dots into Skills from the Path list (I choose one each into Command, Culture, and Pilot) and two dots into Edges from the Path list (I put both in Wealth).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25506,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","user":"Shepherdboi","date":". 12-31-2021, 07:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-31T16:32:14-08:00","id":1471568,"title":"","content":"Ah! Right! I understand now. Thank you for the help. Happy new year.<br /> <br /> Edit:<br /> Thank you for taking the time to post an additional example. Make sense to me now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:georgia\">Organizer for the Dead Gamers Society: The So Cal World of Darkness Meetup. </span><a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/</a>","edited":{"userid":85,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/85-drumheller","user":"Drumheller","date":". 12-31-2021, 07:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/85-drumheller","name":"Drumheller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar85_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"55"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}